    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:'Noto Sans SC';font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;margin:0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">嚎風環流Howling Gyre環繞在氣元素位面寧靜的阿卡Aaqa疆域周圍，是個由狂風驟雨凝成的無盡風暴區域。長着禽類樣貌的阿蘭寇拉鳥人族在這裏漫遊，兼顧着空中巡邏隊來爲自己家園那多風的邊界抵禦來自土元素位面的敵襲，其中就有作爲其誓敵的石像鬼gargoyle。<br /></span><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>邪惡元素之敵Eniemies of Elemental Evil。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">阿蘭寇拉鷹人服務於阿卡的風之公爵Wind Dukes，爲其在位面中搜尋着邪惡元素的神廟。它們監視着懷有敵意的元素生物並將其消滅，或是彙報給風之公爵。<br />在主物質位面時，阿蘭寇拉鷹人會築巢於高山之巔，且更偏愛靠近氣元素位面傳送門所在的某些山峯。阿蘭寇拉們從這些至高處觀望着元素入侵的跡象，同時也警惕着家鄉位面的隱患。阿蘭寇拉鷹人喜歡像風一樣無拘無束、永不停步的生活，但也會爲抵禦邪惡元素侵襲而長年駐守某地。<br />阿蘭寇拉鷹人沒有領土和財產所有權的概念，金銀珠寶與各種珍稀物料在它們看來也沒太大意義。在它們眼裏，個體應當只取所需而把其餘交諸他人。<br /></span><span style=\"font-family:黑體\"><em><strong>尋覓七碎片Search for the Seven Shards。</strong></em></span><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">阿卡的風之公爵們源自曾經統御了衆多世界，名爲瓦緹vatti的元素種族。直至一個名爲混沌女王Queen of Chaos的存在忽然出現，一場針對瓦緹族統治的戰爭隨之打響。爲與之抗衡，七名瓦緹英雄彙集自身力量，製作出強大的<em>秩序權杖Rod of Law</em>。隨後在一場對抗混沌女王手下主帥狼蛛密斯卡Mishka the Wolf Spider的戰鬥中，一名瓦緹將權杖如長矛般刺入密斯卡體內將它殺死。權杖也因此破碎，化作七枚碎片流落於多元宇宙中。阿蘭寇拉們至今還在尋覓碎片的蹤跡，希望有日得以重鑄那柄傳世的<em>七節權杖Rod of Seven Parts</em>。<br /></span></p><p>Aarakocra range the Howling Gyre, an endless storm of mighty winds and lashing rains that surrounds the tranquil realm of Aaqa in the Elemental Plane of Air. Making aerial patrols, these birdlike humanoids guard the windy borders of their home against invaders from the Elemental Plane of Earth, such as gargoyles, their sworn enemies.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Enemies of Elemental Evil\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Enemies of Elemental Evil.</span> In service to the Wind Dukes of Aaqa, aarakocra scout the planes in search of temples of Elemental Evil. They spy on malign elemental creatures and then either take the fight to those creatures or report back to the Wind Dukes.</p><p>On the Material Plane, aarakocra create aeries atop the highest mountains, especially peaks near portals to the Elemental Plane of Air. From such heights, aarakocra watch for signs of elemental incursions, as well as for nascent threats to their home plane. Aarakocra prefer to live their lives like the wind-unburdened and ever moving-yet they watch over a region for years if that's what it takes to guard against the incursions of Elemental Evil.</p><p>Aarakocra have no concept of political borders or property ownership, and the value of gems, gold, and other precious materials means little to aarakocra. In their eyes, a creature should use what is necessary and then cast what is left on the wind for others to use.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Search for the Seven Shards\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Search for the Seven Shards.</span> The Wind Dukes of Aaqa come from a race of elemental beings called the vaati, which once ruled many worlds. A creature known as the Queen of Chaos arose and initiated an interplanar war against vaati rule. To combat the threat, seven vaati heroes combined their powers to create the mighty <em>Rod of Law</em>. In a battle against the queen's greatest general, Mishka the Wolf Spider, a vaati killed Mishka by thrusting the rod into him like a spear. The rod shattered into seven shards that scattered across the multiverse. Aaracokra seek signs of the pieces' locations in order to rebuild what is now known as the <em>Rod of Seven Parts</em>.</p></div></div><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Summoning Air Elementals\"><p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\"><strong>變體：召喚氣元素</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">五名彼此間距離不超過30尺的阿蘭寇拉鷹人可以用魔法召喚一個氣元素。其五人中的每一個都必須在連續三回合中用其動作與移動力來維持專注，以進行一種空中的演舞（如同專注於法術）。當五人都完成各自第三回合的演舞后，氣元素將出現在這些召喚者身邊60尺內一個未被佔據的空間。被召喚的氣元素對召喚者們保持友善，並服從它們的語言命令。該元素持續存在1小時，或是直至它自己或其全部召喚者死亡，其召喚者也可以用一個附贈動作將其遣返。召喚者在完成一次短休前不能再次施展該演舞，而當該氣元素回到氣元素位面時，任何在其周邊5尺內的阿蘭寇拉鷹人都可與其一同返回。</span></p><h4 class=\"rd__h rd__h--2-inset\" data-title-index=\"3\"><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Summoning Air Elementals</span></h4><p>Five aarakocra within 30 feet of each other can magically summon an air elemental. Each of the five must use its action and movement on three consecutive turns to perform an aerial dance and must maintain concentration while doing so (as if concentrating on a spell). When all five have finished their third turn of the dance, the elemental appears in an unoccupied space within 60 feet of them. It is friendly toward them and obeys their spoken commands. It remains for 1 hour, until it or all its summoners die, or until any of its summoners dismisses it as a bonus action. A summoner can't perform the dance again until it finishes a short rest. When the elemental returns to the Elemental Plane of Air, any aarakocra within 5 feet of it can return with it.</p></div></div></div>",
