    {
      "_id": "ys8CYgQ2HW1IG4QY",
      "name": "召喚氣元素Summon Air Elemental",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "12",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:宋體\">五名彼此間距離不超過30尺的阿蘭寇拉鷹人可以用魔法召喚一個氣元素。其五人中的每一個都必須在連續三回合中用其動作與移動力來維持專注，以進行一種空中的演舞（如同專注於法術）。當五人都完成各自第三回合的演舞后，氣元素將出現在這些召喚者身邊60尺內一個未被佔據的空間。被召喚的氣元素對召喚者們保持友善，並服從它們的語言命令。該元素持續存在1小時，或是直至它自己或其全部召喚者死亡，其召喚者也可以用一個附贈動作將其遣返。召喚者在完成一次短休前不能再次施展該演舞，而當該氣元素回到氣元素位面時，任何在其周邊5尺內的阿蘭寇拉鷹人都可與其一同返回。</span></p><p>Five aarakocra within 30 feet of each other can magically summon an @creature[air elemental]. Each of the five must use its action and movement on three consecutive turns to perform an aerial dance and must maintain @status[concentration] while doing so (as if @status[concentration||concentrating] on a spell). When all five have finished their third turn of the dance, the elemental appears in an unoccupied space within 60 feet of them. It is friendly toward them and obeys their spoken commands. It remains for 1 hour, until it or all its summoners die, or until any of its summoners dismisses it as a bonus action. A summoner can't perform the dance again until it finishes a short rest. When the elemental returns to the Elemental Plane of Air, any aarakocra within 5 feet of it can return with it.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "requirements": "",
        "uses": {
          "max": "",
          "recovery": [],
          "spent": 0
        },
