          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">如果阿蘭寇拉鷹人在飛行中向一個目標直線俯衝至少</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">30</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺，再以一次近戰攻擊命中對方，則該攻擊對目標造成額外</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1d6</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）點傷害。</span></p><p>If the aarakocra is flying and dives at least 30 feet straight toward a target and then hits it with a melee weapon attack, the attack deals an extra 3 ([[/damage 1d6]]) damage to the target.</p></div>",
